## P2-4: --index/--protection are creation flags but must be repeated on every later CLI call

create with non-default config:
$ memorygene --db p.db --index plain --protection none ingest examples/candidate.json
{
  "id": "demo-1",
  "status": "confirmed",
exit=0

query with CLI defaults (README examples never pass these flags):
$ memorygene --db p.db current --namespace demo --subject fictional-user --topic preference.favorite_flower
{"error": "Database schema/config mismatch; explicit migration required"}
exit=2

create with --protection copy then query with defaults:
{"error": "Database schema/config mismatch; explicit migration required"}
exit=2
